        "valueString": "Patient reports headache for 4 days, gradual onset, bifrontal/temporal, dull with occasional sharp twinges, 5–7/10, worse in the evening and with screens; some relief with Panadol. Not thunderclap or the worst ever. Mild nausea."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
